   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS 2025 Casa Refugiados Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x201c;Building peace and social inclusion with refugees and people experiencing forced displacement in Mexico City, 2025&#x201d; project in Mexico, implemented by Programa Casa Refugiados   , aims to contribute to the construction of peaceful and inclusive communities in Mexico City through participatory processes of awareness-raising, peace education, and social fabric strengthening. These processes promote effective social and economic integration, the recognition of rights, and collaborative coexistence between refugees, people on the move, and host communities, grounded in a culture of encounter and the peaceful transformation of conflicts.</narrative>
  </description>
